---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import siteConfig from '~/config/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms"
  heading="Terms"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  intro="Terms for using this portfolio site."
  description={`Terms of use for ${siteConfig.name}.`}
  crumbs={[{ label: 'Terms' }]}
>
  <section class="wrap sec" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="prose rev">
      <h2>Using this site</h2>
      <p>
        This is a personal portfolio. You are welcome to read it, link to it and quote from it
        with attribution. Republishing whole pages as your own is not permitted.
      </p>

      <h2>Work shown here</h2>
      <p>
        The analytics reporting case study is a portfolio demo built with synthetic data. It
        does not contain client data and does not describe a client engagement. Any future
        client work will be published only with permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        Content is published in good faith and may change over time. Nothing on this site is a
        contractual offer; scope and terms are agreed in writing before work starts.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        External links are provided for convenience. The sites they point to are not under
        this site's control.
      </p>

      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>
        The site is provided as is. To the extent the law allows, no liability is accepted for
        loss arising from its use.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Send them to <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contact.email}`}>{siteConfig.contact.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
